laim: 3\n53\t  description: Instruction ablation — 去掉 instruction text 测 RSA 变化\n54\t  priority: P0\n55\t  gpu_budget_hours: 2\n56\t  deps: []\n57\t  registry_id: d021_instruction_ablation\n58\t  status: done\n59\t  result: Δ=0.004 << 0.10 threshold, instruction has no effect\n60\t- id: plan_007\n61\t  claim: 3\n62\t  description: 2×2 matrix (training × instruction) — 四条件全收敛\n63\t  priority: P0\n64\t  gpu_budget_hours: 1\n65\t  deps:\n66\t  - plan_006\n67\t  registry_id: d027_trained_no_inst_rsa\n68\t  status: done\n69\t  result: All 4 cells ≈ 0.48-0.49, Bootstrap CI includes 0\n70\t- id: plan_008\n71\t  claim: 3\n72\t  description: Random instruction control — 用随机/无意义 instruction 替代真实 instruction，验证\n73\t    instruction content 不影响 RSA\n74\t  priority: P1\n75\t  gpu_budget_hours: 2\n76\t  deps:\n77\t  - plan_006\n78\t  registry_id: plan_008_random_inst_control\n79\t  status: done\n80\t  result: 'All conditions within ±0.017: normal 0.489, random 0.484, shuffled 0.483,\n81\t    empty 0.472. Instruction content invariant.'\n82\t  note: 排除 trivial separability 攻击面 (D024). 三重不变性完备：training + instruction presence\n83\t    + instruction content.\n84\t- id: plan_011\n85\t  claim:\n86\t  - 1\n87\t  - 2\n88\t  - 3\n89\t  description: Full-layer R² scan — 33 layers × 2 conditions × 2 aggregations = 132\n90\t    probes，验证 R² per-layer curve 是否与 RSA inverted-U 一致\n91\t  priority: P0\n92\t  gpu_budget_hours: 1\n93\t  deps:\n94\t  - plan_001\n95\t  registry_id: plan_011_fulllayer_r2\n96\t  status: done\n97\t  result: 'R² also inverted-U. Trained peaks: imgmean L8=0.655, lastpre L13=0.678\n98\t    (both > proj 0.630). Training shifts R² peak and causes RSA-R² convergence. Untrained\n99\t    L10-L13 pathological (R²≈0). Best-vs-best: imgmean Δ=+0.015 p=0.006, lastpre Δ=+0.069\n100\t    p<0.0001.'\n101\t- id: plan_012\n102\t  claim:\n103\t  - 1\n104\t  - 2\n105\t  description: CLIP-ViT pretraining control — 用 CLIP ViT-L 替代 SigLIP，区分 VL pretraining\n106\t    贡献 vs encoder quality\n1