{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Y5T41sJRX8aoyZBVM3moXU","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have a complete picture. Let me compile my findings:\n\n## Comprehensive Search Results: Experiment Plans and Definitions\n\nI've conducted a very thorough search of `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15` and found extensive documentation of experiment plans. Here are the key findings:\n\n### **Primary Experiment Plan File**\n**Location:** `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/experiment_plan.yaml`\n\nThis is the main experiment planning document containing 13 planned experiments (plan_001 through plan_013, with plan_010 and plan_011 referenced separately).\n\n---\n\n### **Experiment Status Summary**\n\n#### **COMPLETED EXPERIMENTS (12 of 13):**\n\n1. **plan_001** - SigLIP+Projector RSA vs Full VLA vs DINO (DONE) - RSA=0.615 >> VLA 0.488 >> DINO 0.388\n2. **plan_002** - DINO baseline RSA (DONE) - RSA=0.388\n3. **plan_003** - Per-layer RSA curve (DONE) - Trained inverted-U curve (L0=0.612→L12=0.628 peak→L32=0.422)\n4. **plan_004** - Output head analysis (DONE) - Projector frozen, LLM weights uniformly distributed\n5. **plan_005** - 6 probing methods × 2 benchmarks (DONE) - All 6 methods consistent\n6. **plan_006** - Instruction ablation (DONE) - Δ=0.004 << 0.10 threshold\n7. **plan_007** - 2×2 matrix (training × instruction) (DONE) - All 4 cells ≈ 0.48-0.49\n8. **plan_008** - Random instruction control (DONE) - Instruction content invariant (Δ < 0.017)\n9. **plan_009** - CKA verification (DONE) - CKA-RSA dissociation confirmed\n10. **plan_011** - Full-layer R² scan (DONE) - R² also shows inverted-U pattern\n11. **plan_012** - CLIP-ViT pretraining control (DONE) - CLIP RSA=0.557, R²=0.587\n12. **plan_013** - Branch-split RSA (DONE) - DINOv2 branch=0.619, SigLIP branch=0.621, Fused=0.634\n\n#### **IN-PROGRESS/PLANNED EXPERIMENT (1 of 13):**\n\n**plan_010** - **LI