A untrained (0.485) >> DINO (0.388)\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Frozen SigLIP+projector 保留最强 action-aligned geometry（RSA=0.615）。LLM 各层将表征\n      从视觉对齐空间转换到语言/动作解码空间，RSA 降至 ~0.488（降幅 20.7%）。关键发现是\n      trained ≈ untrained（Δ=0.003），证明 RSA 测量的几何结构由 frozen encoder 决定，\n      LLM 训练不改善这一度量。DINO 虽是强 self-supervised baseline（0.388），但缺乏\n      vision-language alignment 导致 RSA 显著低于 SigLIP。这一层级为 C3（encoder geometry\n      observation）奠定基础，同时排除了 \"训练改善表征几何\" 的错误 narrative。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Encoder-to-VLA RSA Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Source\", \"RSA ρ\", \"95% CI\", \"vs DINO Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"SigLIP+Proj\", \"0.615\", \"[0.526, 0.695]\", \"+0.227\"]\n          - [\"VLA Trained Peak\", \"0.488\", \"—\", \"+0.100\"]\n          - [\"VLA Untrained Peak\", \"0.485\", \"—\", \"+0.097\"]\n          - [\"DINO cls_token\", \"0.388\", \"—\", \"baseline\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 4 sources (SigLIP, VLA trained, VLA untrained, DINO) RSA 值 with error bars\"\n    analysis: |\n      SigLIP >> VLA >> DINO 层级确立。LLM 是 action-relevant geometry 的消费者而非增强者。\n      为 C1 framework 提供定量基础：frozen encoder 是结构源头。\n\n  - name: \"DINO Baseline RSA\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: \"Standalone DINOv2 作为 vision-only baseline，建立 encoder quality 下界\"\n    expected_results:\n      temporal_distance_rho_pooled: 0.833\n      per_task_rho_mean: 0.901\n      R2_action_probe: 0.687\n      subtask_macro_auc: 0.972\n      control_b_permutation_rho: 0.039\n    result_rationale: |\n      DINOv2 cls_token 在纯视觉层面已捕获强时序/动作结构（per-task ρ=0.901，R²=0.687），\n      证明 self-supervised per-patch objective 创建了与 robot action 对齐的表征。但 RSA=0.388\n      低于 SigLIP(0.615)，说明 vision-language 对齐提供额外增益。Label permutation control\n      （ρ=0.039）排除 probe 过拟合。DINOv2 作为 cross-encoder 比较的锚点：任何 VLA encoder\n      component 的 RSA 必须 >> 0.388 才有意义。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"DINOv2 per-task ρ 分布 boxplot，显示 cross-task variance\"\n    analys